<title>USA: Teleport gets OK to enter D.C. market.</title>
<headline>Teleport gets OK to enter D.C. market.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teleport Communications Group Inc said Tuesday it had received authorization from the Public Service Commission of the District of Columbia to provide local telephone service to the area.</p>
<p>The company did not say when it would begin offering the service.</p>
</text>
